The plane $x=1$ holds $x$ constant, so $y$ varies and the section slope is $dz/dy=f_y(x,y)$. Substitute the ordered coordinates of $P$:

$$
\begin{aligned}
m=f_y(1,2)&=\frac{{1}^{2}+1}{{1}^{2}(2)^{2}}+(2)\sqrt{1} \\
&=\frac{2}{4}+2(1) \\
&=\frac{5}{2}
\end{aligned}
$$

The height $3$ is not an input to the supplied partial derivative.
